OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith some clear spells at first,
OL,7,Fclouding over by the second half of
OL,8,Fthe night with a light southerly
OL,9,Fbreeze. Feeling chilly in certain
OL,10,Flocations, where temperatures may drop
OL,11,Fto single figures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FCloudy but dry start to the
OL,14,Fday, cloud gradually thickens and
OL,15,Fturning breezier as rain spreads
OL,16,Feastwards. A drier and clearer night
OL,17,Ffor most to follow with the wind
OL,18,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
