OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and light winds on Monday.
OL,7,FCloudy and breezier on Tuesday, with
OL,8,Fovernight rain. A wet and cloudy start
OL,9,Fto Wednesday, but brightening up
OL,10,Flater. Temperatures slightly above
OL,11,Faverage.
